Third-party projects

  doom64-dc            https://github.com/jnmartin84/doom64-dc
                       jnmartin84's Dreamcast port, which this repository is:
                       its game code (src/) and ROM extractor (wadtool/, GPL
                       v3), with the Xbox port's changes marked XBOX:. Its
                       data -- the selfboot/ folder: the music, the sound
                       effects, the normal maps, the Knee-Deep-in-the-Dead
                       levels, the cover art -- is not committed here:
                       setup.py fetches the repository into extern/ at the
                       revision it pins (DOOM64_DC_REV) and copies that
                       folder into data/ on your machine.
  DOOM64-RE            https://github.com/Erick194/DOOM64-RE
                       Erick194's reverse-engineered Doom 64, which the
                       Dreamcast port is built on.
  Doom 64 XE           https://github.com/Immorpher/doom64xe
                       Immorpher's Doom 64 XE / Merciless Edition, which the
                       Dreamcast port follows.
  KallistiOS           https://github.com/KallistiOS/KallistiOS
                       The Dreamcast OS. Platform/xbox/ reimplements the part
                       of its API the game uses, with KOS's own names, types,
                       constants and struct layouts, and carries code ported
                       from KOS itself, which stays under the KOS License
                       (Platform/xbox/LICENSE.KOS):
                         dc/sound/aica_comm.h (copied unchanged),
                         aica_cmd_iface.h and aica.h
                           (sound/arm/aica_cmd_iface.h, aica.h),
                         aica/aica_fw_xbox.c (sound/arm/main.c, aica.c),
                         aica/aica_bus_xbox.c (sound/snd_mem.c, snd_iface.c),
                         kos_snd_stream_xbox.c (sound/snd_stream.c),
                         kos_sfxmgr_xbox.c (sound/snd_sfxmgr.c),
                         kos_vmu_pkg.c (util/vmu_pkg.c),
                         kos_extra_xbox.c: the VMU framebuffer
                           (util/vmu_fb.c),
                         pvr_xbox.c: the texture twiddle
                           (hardware/pvr/pvr_texture.c), the polygon and
                           sprite header compilers (hardware/pvr/pvr_prim.c)
                           and the fog table functions
                           (hardware/pvr/pvr_fog.c, pvr_fog_tables.h),
                         dc/pvr.h, dc/matrix.h, dc/vec3f.h, dc/fmath.h,
                         dc/maple/keyboard.h, dc/maple/mouse.h, dc/vector.h:
                           KOS's declarations.
  Star-Fox-64-X,       The earlier Xbox ports (Team Resurgent), whose
  SSB-X                platform layer Platform/xbox/ began as.
  RXDK                 Team Resurgent's original-Xbox development kit: the
                       toolchain, SDK and Visual Studio integration the
                       build uses. Installed separately, not part of this
                       repository.

